{"_v":1,"id":"the-merchant-of-venice-2010","cs":77,"rc":9,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"Variety","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2010/film/reviews/lapland-odyssey-1117943676/","d":"2010-11-01","q":"Al Pacino's Shylock is a commanding, complex creation that gives this revival of Shakespeare's problematic play its primary reason for being."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2010/11/merchant_of_venice_pacino_rabe.html","d":"2010-11-02","q":"This transfer is dear bought, that’s for sure."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2010/11/19/theater/reviews/19merchant.html","d":"2010-11-19","q":"Al Pacino's Shylock is a man of wounded dignity and cunning intelligence, and his presence elevates this straightforward revival of Shakespeare's problem play."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB10001424052748704658204575611653158234076","d":"2010-11-12","q":"Al Pacino's Shylock is a compelling figure, but the production around him is uneven and at times confusing in its interpretive choices."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/life/theater/reviews/2010-11-15-merchant_ST_N.htm","d":"2010-11-15","q":"She reaches into our hearts and haunts our minds, as this Merchant does in general."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"http://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/pacino-s-merchant-of-venice-a-best-buy-1.2464119","q":"Their combined work represents nothing short of a master class in acting Shakespeare."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/page/regional/boston/b626.html","d":"2010-11-15","q":"Al Pacino's Shylock is a fully formed character study that finds new depths in Shakespeare's most controversial figure, delivering a performance that is both commanding and surprisingly vulnerable."},{"cn":"John Simon","o":"Bloomberg","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://www.bloomberg.com/news/2010-11-16/pacino-s-fiery-shylock-burns-in-broadway-merchant-john-simon.html","d":"2010-11-16","q":"Credit Sullivan's engaging conception of the play."},{"cn":"Michael Sommers","o":"New Jersey Newsroom","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.newjerseynewsroom.com/movies/review-al-pacino-and-lily-rabe-illuminate-a-dark-merchant-of-venice","q":"No doubt a villain in Pacino's merciless portrayal, even the interpolation of a cruel baptismal sequence secures little sympathy for this dangerous character."}],"au":{"score":53,"designation":"Disliking","sources":{"mz":{"s":60,"c":31,"sr":3},"th":{"s":36,"c":14}}},"hi":"/images/shows/the-merchant-of-venice-2010/hero.webp","ta":"235 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2010-10-19","ca":[{"n":"Al Pacino","r":"Shylock"},{"n":"David Harbour","r":"Bassanio"},{"n":"Byron Jennings","r":"Antonio"},{"n":"Jesse L. Martin","r":"Gratiano"},{"n":"Lily Rabe","r":"Portia"},{"n":"Happy Anderson","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Gerry Bamman","r":"Duke of Venice"},{"n":"Liza J. Bennett","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Marsha Stephanie Blake","r":"Nerissa"},{"n":"Christopher Fitzgerald","r":"Launcelot Gobbo"},{"n":"Glenn Fleshler","r":"Antonio's Man"},{"n":"Luke Forbes","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Herb Foster","r":"Balthasar"},{"n":"Jade Hawk","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Bethany Heinrich","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Curt Hostetter","r":"Stephano"},{"n":"Peter Francis James","r":"Salerio"},{"n":"Tia James","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Isaiah Johnson","r":"Prince of Morocco"},{"n":"Charles Kimbrough","r":"Prince of Arragon"},{"n":"Kelsey Kurz","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Heather Lind","r":"Jessica"},{"n":"Brian Keith MacDonald","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Dorien Makhloghi","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Seth Numrich","r":"Lorenzo"},{"n":"Matthew Rauch","r":"Solanio"},{"n":"Baylen T